        <p source="#source-5126-5188"><seg source="#source-5126-5141">かぎりなき</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5141-5162"><rb>生命</rb><rt>いのち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5162-5165">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5165-5186"><rb>苦痛</rb><rt>くつう</rt></ruby></p>
        <p source="#source-5188-5249"><seg source="#source-5188-5203">かぎりある</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5203-5218"><rb>胸</rb><rt>むね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5218-5221">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5221-5239"><rb>力</rb><rt>ちから</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5239-5249">に。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-5249-5317"><seg source="#source-5249-5270">あはれ、なほ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5270-5291"><rb>喇叭</rb><rt>らつぱ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5291-5297">吹く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5297-5312"><rb>息</rb><rt>いき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5312-5317">、</seg></p>
