      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-5552-5596"><seg source="#source-5552-5564">青き葉の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5564-5585"><rb>銀杏</rb><rt>いてふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5585-5596">の林、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-5596-5654"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5596-5611"><rb>細</rb><rt>ほそ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5611-5620">らなる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5620-5641"><rb>若樹</rb><rt>わかき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5641-5654">の林。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-5654-5716"><seg source="#source-5654-5669">はた、青き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5669-5687"><rb>白日</rb><rt>ひる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5687-5690">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5690-5702"><rb>日</rb><rt>ひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5702-5716">かげに、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-5716-5774"><seg source="#source-5716-5722">葉も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5722-5737"><rb>顫</rb><rt>ふる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5737-5740">ふ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5740-5761"><rb>銀杏</rb><rt>いてふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5761-5774">の林。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-5774-5812"><seg source="#source-5774-5812">そのもとを北へかすめる、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-5812-5864"><seg source="#source-5812-5827">ひややけき</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5827-5842"><rb>路</rb><rt>みち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5842-5864">のひとすぢ、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-5864-5920"><seg source="#source-5864-5879">かすかにも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5879-5903"><rb>胡弓</rb><rt>こきゆう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5903-5920">まさぐり、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-5920-5966"><seg source="#source-5920-5966">ゆめのごと、われはたどりぬ。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-5966-6007"><seg source="#source-5966-5978">青き葉の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-5978-5999"><rb>銀杏</rb><rt>いてふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-5999-6007">の林</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-6007-6059"><seg source="#source-6007-6022">行き行けど</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-6022-6037"><rb>路</rb><rt>みち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-6037-6059">は尽きなく。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-6059-6121"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-6059-6074"><rb>細</rb><rt>ほそ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-6074-6083">らなる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-6083-6104"><rb>若樹</rb><rt>わかき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-6104-6121">のはやし、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-6121-6194"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-6121-6145"><rb>頬白</rb><rt>ほほじろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-6145-6148">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-6148-6160"><rb>鳴</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-6160-6163">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-6163-6175"><rb>音</rb><rt>ね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-6175-6194">もきかず。</seg></p>
