        <p source="#source-6779-6838"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-6779-6794"><rb>薄</rb><rt>うす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-6794-6809">らなる青の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-6809-6830"><rb>絹衣</rb><rt>すずし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-6830-6838">も、</seg></p>
