      <div>
        <p source="#source-7257-7294"><seg source="#source-7257-7294">森の奥ほのかにくらし。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-7294-7329"><seg source="#source-7294-7329">夏のすゑ、長月はじめ、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-7329-7372"><seg source="#source-7329-7372">あはれ、日も薄らうすらに、</seg></p>
