        <p source="#source-8038-8094"><seg source="#source-8038-8059">そをめぐり秋の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8059-8077"><rb>笙</rb><rt>しやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8077-8080">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8080-8092"><rb>音</rb><rt>ね</rt></ruby></p>
        <p source="#source-8094-8143"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8094-8109"><rb>蕭</rb><rt>しめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8109-8143">やかにひそかに愁ふ。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-8143-8202"><seg source="#source-8143-8155">響かふは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8155-8170"><rb>角</rb><rt>つぬ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8170-8173">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8173-8194"><rb>音色</rb><rt>ねいろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8194-8202">か、</seg></p>
