        <p source="#source-8263-8295"><seg source="#source-8263-8295">かくてまた暗き葉越に</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-8295-8332"><seg source="#source-8295-8332">鳩の笛沁みはわたれど。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-8332-8379"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8332-8353"><rb>薄黄</rb><rt>うすぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8353-8379">なる光の透かし、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-8379-8431"><seg source="#source-8379-8394">ひとすぢの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8394-8409"><rb>昨</rb><rt>きそ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8409-8431">のほめきに、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-8431-8466"><seg source="#source-8431-8466">ほの白う暮れてたたずむ</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-8466-8503"><seg source="#source-8466-8503">物おもふ色のしづけさ。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-8503-8543"><seg source="#source-8503-8543">森はいまほのかにくらし。</seg></p>
