      <div>
        <p source="#source-9822-9902"><seg source="#source-9822-9852">いと高くいと深くいと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9852-9867"><rb>静</rb><rt>しづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9867-9876">にいと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9876-9891"><rb>蕭</rb><rt>しめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9891-9902">やげる</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-9902-10009"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9902-9914"><rb>夜</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9914-9932">の森のかげ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9932-9947"><rb>暗</rb><rt>くら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9947-9950">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9950-9968"><rb>冷</rb><rt>ひやゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9968-9974">なる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9974-9992"><rb>列</rb><rt>つらね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9992-10009">のもとを、</seg></p>
