        <p source="#source-10138-10239"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10138-10153"><rb>細</rb><rt>ほそ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10153-10162">らなる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10162-10186"><rb>赤楊</rb><rt>はんのき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10186-10189">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10189-10207"><rb>列</rb><rt>つらね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10207-10239">、そのもとの底の底を</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 11em" rend="first-line-indent(11)" source="#source-10239-10297"><seg source="#source-10239-10297">われはあゆむ。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-10297-10371"><seg source="#source-10297-10333">いと高くいと深く沈みたる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10333-10354"><rb>憂愁</rb><rt>うれひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10354-10371">のもとを、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-10371-10496"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10371-10398"><rb>真素肌</rb><rt>ますはだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10398-10419">のましろなる、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10419-10434"><rb>衣</rb><rt>きぬ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10434-10443">つけぬ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10443-10467"><rb>常若</rb><rt>とこわか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10467-10470">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10470-10488"><rb>矜</rb><rt>ほこり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10488-10496">もて</seg></p>
