      <div>
        <p source="#source-43759-43818"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-43759-43774"><rb>跳</rb><rt>おど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-43774-43792">りいづ、赤き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-43792-43813"><rb>獣</rb><rt>けだもの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-43813-43818">、</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 4em" rend="first-line-indent(4)" source="#source-43818-43853"><seg source="#source-43818-43853">どんどん………</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-43853-43930"><seg source="#source-43853-43871">とみかう見、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-43871-43886"><rb>円</rb><rt>まろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-43886-43907">らに笑ひ、はた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-43907-43922"><rb>跳</rb><rt>おど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-43922-43930">る。</seg></p>
