        <p source="#source-50492-50574"><seg source="#source-50492-50522">見え、かつ、消えぬ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-50522-50546"><rb>大鳥</rb><rt>おほとり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-50546-50574">の強きはばたき。</seg></p>
