        <p source="#source-92316-92354"><seg source="#source-92316-92322">ああ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-92322-92349"><rb>七月</rb><rt>しちぐわつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-92349-92354">、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-92354-92434"><seg source="#source-92354-92381">山の火ふけぬ。――</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-92381-92411"><rb>花柑子</rb><rt>はなかうじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-92411-92434">咲く野も近み、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-92434-92508"><seg source="#source-92434-92446">月白ろむ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-92446-92479"><rb>葡萄畑</rb><rt>ぶだうばたけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-92479-92482">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-92482-92494"><rb>夜</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-92494-92508">の靄に、</seg></p>
